  "description_nl": "2026-10-07: A loss set off against up to four gains, the first first: each takes what it can of what is left (s.70, s.71, s.74, s.71B - the order is chip myreturn.cg_rules stcl_order / ltcl_order). used = what each gain absorbed, left = the loss not set off, rest = each gain after.",
